# Token Budget

- Orchestrate cheap, implement targeted: premium/IDE model for tools, git, small edits; offload large codegen/review to FreeLLMAPI when available.
- Always-on rules stay short; multi-step procedures belong in `.ade/skills/*/SKILL.md`.
- One canonical source for endpoints, ports, model names; rules link — never duplicate.
- Session hygiene: after a long task, prefer a fresh thread for unrelated work.
- Batch independent reads with parallel tool calls.
